WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.444
Reading the analysis.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.115
Before you claim anything,

3
00:00:05.115 --> 00:00:08.022
see what your record actually shows.

4
00:00:08.572 --> 00:00:11.491
Figures are grouped by what they measure.

5
00:00:11.491 --> 00:00:15.554
Hours, kilometres and dollars are never added together.

6
00:00:16.104 --> 00:00:20.210
The summary says it plainly: how often you logged,

7
00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:24.839
your longest gap, and where this pace will leave you.

8
00:00:25.389 --> 00:00:28.261
Coverage shows which entries are thin,

9
00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:32.660
so you can strengthen them before a report cites them.

10
00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:38.320
And a figure on Today opens into the entries behind it.
